2. Calculate the regions:
   - \(A_X = 49\pi - 36\pi = 13\pi\)
   - \(A_Y = 36\pi - 16\pi = 20\pi\)
   - \(A_Z = 16\pi\)
3. Identify max and min:
   - Max area = \(20\pi\) (Y)
   - Min area = \(13\pi\) (X)
4. Difference = \(20\pi - 13\pi = 7\pi\)

