Next, we calculate the area of the entire paper and subtract the area of the picture:
- Area of paper: \(6 \times 8\)
- Area of picture: \(5 \times 7\)
The area of the visible red border is the difference between these two areas.

===== STAGE 2 : PYTHON CODE =====
