Next, we determine which two-digit numbers (from 11 to 66) are divisible by 8. The two-digit multiples of 8 in this range are 16, 24, 32, 40, 48, 56. We will count how many of these can be formed with the given die rolls.

===== STAGE 2 : PYTHON CODE =====
