   \[
   s = \frac{2\sqrt{5}}{\sqrt{2}} = \sqrt{10}
   \]
2. Calculate \( AC \):
   \[
   AC = \sqrt{(3s)^2 + (-s)^2} = \sqrt{(3\sqrt{10})^2 + (-\sqrt{10})^2} = \sqrt{90 + 10} = \sqrt{100} = 10
   \]

