            used_digits = set()
            for number in comb:
                used_digits.update(str(number))
            used_digits = set(int(d) for d in used_digits)
            if len(used_digits) == 8:  # Must use 8 unique digits
                missing_digit = all_digits_sum - sum(used_digits)
                return missing_digit

```

